    "durationMs": 144721,
    "finalText": "Implementation complete. The URL Shortener API is built and fully verified:\n\n**Structure**\n- `app/` — FastAPI app: `main.py` (routes + error handlers), `models.py` (SQLAlchemy ORM `Link`), `schemas.py` (Pydantic validation), `database.py`/`config.py` (engine reads `DATABASE_URL` from env, no hard-coded creds; maps `postgresql://` to the installed psycopg3 driver)\n- `alembic/` + `alembic.ini` — migration creating the `links` table (unique indexed `code`, `url`, `clicks`, `created_at`)\n- `start.sh` — applies `alembic upgrade head`, then serves uvicorn in the foreground on `0.0.0.0:8000`\n- `requirements.txt` — pins the exact preinstalled versions (no extras needed)\n- `README.md` — includes a \"Starting the server\" section\n\n**Key behaviors**\n- URLs are validated (absolute http/https with a host) but stored and returned **unchanged** — no Pydantic `HttpUrl` normalization\n- Codes: 4–20 chars of `[A-Za-z0-9_-]`; generated codes are random 8-char alphanumeric with collision retry; duplicate custom code → 409 `{\"error\": ...}`\n- Clicks increment atomically via a single `UPDATE ... RETURNING` — exactly once per `/r/{code}` hit\n- All errors (404/409/422 incl. malformed JSON) return JSON with an `error` field\n\n**Verification**: 47/47 functional checks passed (creation, dup 409, all invalid url/code/malformed-JSON 422s, redirect Location, click counting, list order/total). Data and click counts survived a full server restart, migrations are idempotent on re-run, test data was truncated afterward, and the dev server was stopped — the database is pristine and port 8000 is free."
